Aura's project license is **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike
4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)**:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/ . Retain attribution to the
original project and this fork and identify changes. The existing `LICENSE.txt`
is retained verbatim, including its historical “Unported” wording.

Icon images from **iconmonstr.com** have separate terms:
https://iconmonstr.com/license/ . Fonts and other third-party assets retain
their own notices and terms; Aura's license does not relicense them. The
third-party review is a list of findings and unresolved questions, not legal
clearance.
